WEBVTT

00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.400
If the radio waves are emitted from Misakioku, then...

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.400
The skeleton in the basement, with a will of its own.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.400
Did it come back to life?

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:09.950
A cargo helicopter?

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.200
Is that the message from Kamino?

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.830
No—it's not supposed to come
for another four days. It's too early.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:28.340
Heavy firearms in a countryside like this?

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.510
What are they taking from the basement?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.470
It's him.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:36.180
What business does a
self-employed journalist have here?

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:42.610
The skeleton with a will.

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:44.860
Is it still alive?

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:45.900
Don't move.

00:00:46.570 --> 00:00:48.030
No—wait... a second...

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.780
Hands behind your heads!

00:00:55.370 --> 00:00:57.230
Excuse me. I'll be right back.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.960
A Mr. Makita from the consulate
in Kolkata has a message for you.

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:04.960
India?

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:09.970
A message from Mei Kamino—"Tyger."
He said you'd understand.

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:12.680
"6 = 9"? Is it her?

00:01:13.150 --> 00:01:14.260
Put him through.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.350
What a surprise, seeing you guys here.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.350
Could say the same for you.
What are you planning?

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:21.230
I thought I'd list an item in an online auction.

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:24.270
A journalist moonlighting as an antique dealer?

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:26.230
Is this skeleton a Singular Point?

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:30.490
I'm impressed you know about it!
Then we can get straight to the point.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.740
This is the first Singular Point that Ashihara saw.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:38.240
The very beginning, you could say. The magical
lamp that makes the impossible possible.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.420
Singular Points are connected
in a higher dimension, right?

00:01:41.420 --> 00:01:43.980
There's only one even though
it looks like there are many.

00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:46.250
It grows and leads the world to a catastrophe.

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.340
It shouldn't exist in this world.

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:50.260
It must be stopped, or else the world will perish.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:53.390
Catastrophe, you say?

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:56.390
Sounds like you know things that even I don't.

00:01:56.390 --> 00:02:01.520
So what now? Are you going to
save the world? Or is <i>she </i>going to?

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:02.990
She?

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:06.480
Technology can't be reversed,

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:10.110
but it can be controlled by people like me.

00:02:10.110 --> 00:02:14.530
Like it or not, mankind has to
continue living with the Singular Point.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:20.290
It's not man-made.
Once it's destroyed, it'll never exist again.

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:23.660
You're right. But how are you going to destroy it?

00:02:23.660 --> 00:02:27.420
Make a wish to the magical lamp.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.420
I see. You're a romanticist.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:36.050
But is it possible? With the Orthogonal Diagonalizer?

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:39.310
What do you think?

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.770
It doesn't matter what I think,
but thanks for the thrilling story.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:09.340
The incomplete is to blame for all these unknowns

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.970
The incomplete is to blame for all these unknowns

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.110
We'll prove it one way or another

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:25.980
We have to go

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.780
We have to go

00:03:27.780 --> 00:03:29.610
We have to make our move

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.490
We have to make our move

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:35.120
Right now we've got cold feet

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.870
But we'll fight for right

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:38.910
Not everything unanswered needs an answer

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:42.580
Not everything unanswered needs an answer

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.090
We decide what our future means, so stand up, honey

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:49.970
The more difficult it is, the more fun it gets

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:52.470
We decide what our future means, so stand up, honey

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:53.640
We have to be logical, I know

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:56.390
We have to be logical, I know

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:59.520
Yeah, I know that much

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.100
Let's oppose this crisis

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:17.420
Communication is currently down due to red dust...

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.420
The large-scale kaiju Godzilla deflected the attack...

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.050
Flashes of lightning were confirmed.

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.430
Godzilla continues to advance slowly...

00:05:26.850 --> 00:05:29.560
I can't believe you got here by yourself.

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:32.440
We have to stop the Catastrophe right away!

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:37.020
If you have time for this, please just
take me to the Super-Time Computer.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:39.690
I'll show you proof of the Catastrophe.

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:45.740
The world needs the Orthogonal Diagonalizer
right now. The Catastrophe comes next.

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:49.830
Since Li acknowledged your talent,
I'll allow you to fill in her place.

00:05:49.830 --> 00:05:50.660
But...!

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:52.910
If not, you can't stay here.

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:57.460
The loss of our adviser is also a major setback for us.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.350
Over here!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.350
Mei!

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.850
Are you sure about letting an outsider in here?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:18.150
We have no choice. BB wants an assistant.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:23.610
Intruder? Surveillance footage got deleted?
What about the access log?

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:25.360
What!?

00:06:26.030 --> 00:06:30.120
Just what is her problem? She ignores
everything I say and just bosses me around.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.480
Don't get so worked up.

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:37.380
She has complete authority here.
It's better not to cross her.

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:38.630
Still...!

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:41.300
Don't you want to see the Super-Time Computer?

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:45.220
It's right below us. Look behind you.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:53.470
This facility was designed to be
a giant calculator, but it's incomplete.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.770
Incomplete?

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:57.000
It's still being tested.

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:02.150
You see the huge hole?
Ashihara made it to pull out the Singular Point.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:07.230
It reaches 2,000 meters into the Earth.
A work in progress for 20 years.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:10.770
It'll take another seven years
or so to get it to the surface.

00:07:10.770 --> 00:07:14.120
Its completion will drastically change the world.

00:07:14.120 --> 00:07:15.670
That's the theory, anyways.

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:17.460
That's the Singular Point?

00:07:17.460 --> 00:07:22.670
Line up here for the Super-Time Computer tour.

00:07:27.890 --> 00:07:29.430
Cat's out of the bag already.

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:30.810
What's going on?

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:32.930
Our tour is taking a little detour.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:32.930
What?

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.020
And you're to blame.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:36.770
They're not here.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:38.990
BB disappeared?

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:43.380
The Orthogonal Diagonalizer
is being transferred out of storage.

00:07:44.070 --> 00:07:47.240
Damn him. He's out of control.

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:51.780
Level Two shutdown in all areas.
Don't let them out of the building!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:53.040
You stole it?

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.750
Do you think it'll pass using the standard procedures?

00:07:55.750 --> 00:08:00.840
Well, I guess I may have gone bit too far
sending the others all over the world.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:02.130
That's no reason for this!

00:08:02.130 --> 00:08:03.550
It was Li's last will.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.520
Its ability to temporarily contain
red dust has been proven.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:13.310
We can always make more
with the Super-Time Computer.

00:08:15.270 --> 00:08:16.810
They blocked us, huh.

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:18.060
I see them!

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:18.920
They're coming!

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:21.150
I guess the tour is canceled.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.940
So you're the on-site coordinator?

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.450
They opened the door?

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.820
Authorization defect.

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:34.080
Find out who's accessing the system.
Who's helping them?

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:38.910
Over 1,000 regional earthquakes
have been monitored in an hour.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:42.960
They're causing widespread ground subsidence.

00:08:43.500 --> 00:08:47.610
In areas with weak ground,
the groundwater has spouted and started flooding.

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:51.390
Did it cause all that damage by itself?

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:52.270
Mr. Matsubara.

00:08:53.860 --> 00:08:54.850
Reconnaissance?

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.590
We've been spotted.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:00.710
Are they claiming their territory? Let's head back.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.360
What do you guys want?

00:09:03.360 --> 00:09:05.690
Is Mr. Outaki Goro here?

00:09:05.690 --> 00:09:08.360
He's out right now. Wanna leave a message?

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:11.660
I'm Yasuda from the Cabinet Secretariat.

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.620
We came to ask for Outaki Factory's help.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.580
You're too late. He's gone.

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:19.620
Where did he go?

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.870
To Tokyo to hunt Godzilla.

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:28.710
"A quiet midnight crossing of the river,
The enemy is startled by our army...

00:09:28.710 --> 00:09:34.640
Over ten years of preparing for battle,
Yet the enemy easily gets away.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:38.850
Merciful Heaven, blood flows down the river!"

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:42.300
Kai Takehiro. He claims to be a freelance spy.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:43.690
For an unknown organization?

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:49.680
The chopper from Misakioku seems
to have landed on an offshore cargo ship.

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.110
A Panamanian vessel.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:52.610
Where's Kanoko?

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:53.820
In Kolkata.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.620
Kolkata? India?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:59.610
Even the satellite phones are down.

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:01.500
"That is the Catastrophe."

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.540
"What is it?"

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.330
"The shape of the future? What's the time over there?"

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:05.790
Emoji for calm down.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:07.120
"Don't you have a problem right now?"

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:13.760
It sure does sound like a request
to receive something in Tokyo...

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:19.430
The reward is sushi and a helicopter ride?
For receiving the final piece?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:23.390
Is it going to complete a
message with some sort of instruction?

00:10:23.390 --> 00:10:25.440
Maybe Godzilla's weakness?

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:29.690
Why not just tell us up front? Why make us wait?

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:31.440
There must be a reason.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:36.030
A mantra that kills Godzilla. The death of the user.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.160
I wouldn't disclose that info in advance.

00:10:38.160 --> 00:10:39.330
That sounds sinister.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:42.770
It must be info that changes
the future if it's known in advance.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:47.210
Maybe it's a prank from the future.
What if it makes Godzilla stronger?

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:52.460
I'm starting to feel uncomfortable
reviewing the signals over and over.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:53.670
Getting seasick?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.180
No. It's an emotional thing.

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:57.650
Your parts are loosening.

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.100
It's about emotions.

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:00.720
Emotions? Like what?

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:07.230
"Even a priest is moved to sadness,
By a snipe flying in an autumn dusk."

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:10.770
That's just confusing!
Got a more pragmatic example for us?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:14.530
Jet Jaguar processes information like a human being.

00:11:14.530 --> 00:11:18.320
Even we can't logically
explain how we feel all the time.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:20.240
It's kind of like...

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.750
Flames in the darkness. A tiger burning.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:28.630
"Tyger Tyger, burning bright,
In the forests of the night.

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.420
What immortal hand or eye..."

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:36.260
What happened? Did it pass out
because the poem was too emotional?

00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.010
It's being forced to reboot...

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:45.270
Activating boot loader and virtual
environment. Applying initial seed.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.850
What are you doing? Terminate the reboot!

00:11:48.690 --> 00:11:50.520
It won't accept the command.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.780
Cracked? Was there a virus in the message?

00:11:53.780 --> 00:11:59.070
The boot loader is repeating itself
and resetting the protocol each time.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:01.130
Boot loader...

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:08.790
An automatic update?

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:10.230
There's a Manda!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.170
Here it comes! Jet Jaguar, you're up!

00:12:16.340 --> 00:12:18.910
What's the matter? Get on the stage!

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:26.560
Was it you? You seem more like a Whitman than a Blake.

00:12:27.130 --> 00:12:29.560
That's the key to lock the Gates of Hell?

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:33.770
It was Professor Li's last wish.
She wanted this delivered to Tokyo.

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:34.820
Where's Kamino?

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:36.700
She's at SHIVA.

00:12:38.450 --> 00:12:42.910
It was a bold move, sending them all over the world.

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.700
Now with the right code,
can the red dust be neutralized?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.100
Not under Tilda's watch.

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:53.670
Without access to SHIVA,
we can't complete the Orthogonal Diagonalizer.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:55.710
That's why we have Plan B.

00:12:56.040 --> 00:12:59.970
I wanted to avoid a cruise, but I guess we have no choice.

00:12:59.970 --> 00:13:02.090
Are you taking her with you?

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:04.810
Li already paid for her tour.

00:13:04.810 --> 00:13:08.980
And if the Catastrophe is real, it'll change things.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:11.690
All as SHIVA wanted.

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:16.730
Ruins?

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.740
Salunga came out from here.

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:23.240
We'll end up right under SHIVA if we retrace its steps.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.120
That man...!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:31.870
This place is a big melting pot.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:37.690
Our organization is all but a monolothic
mishmash of a number of different operations.

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:41.840
It became unquestionable after Professor Li's death.

00:13:43.220 --> 00:13:47.770
Did you know that Aladdin was born in China?

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:49.390
I thought he was Arabian.

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:52.100
It's said to be a Chinese tale.
Do you know where it's from?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.350
Arabian Nights.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.270
Everyone thought so, but it isn't.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:14:01.650
The Arabic original text about the magical
lamp was translated from the French text.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:07.160
The magical lamp grants any wish of the user

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:09.660
except for one.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.160
Reviving the deceased?

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:17.420
A magical lamp that makes the impossible
possible but brings bad luck to men.

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.420
How would you use it?

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:22.510
If it's going to cause the Catastrophe, I'll break it.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:26.300
How would you break a lamp that's not of this world?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:29.810
I'll ask the lamp to think of a way.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:34.560
I see. Now this one is more practical.
You exceeded my expectations.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.020
We'll let you handle it.

00:14:37.820 --> 00:14:41.240
I'm sorry we can't stay. We have other things to do.

00:14:41.240 --> 00:14:43.070
You're making me clean up the mess.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:45.530
The access account is open.

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:50.620
If you can find a way to
complete the Orthogonal Diagonalizer,

00:14:50.620 --> 00:14:53.410
Tilda will lose her authority.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:58.670
It's your chance to save the world.
I wish I were in your shoes.

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.800
Now we're going spelunking?

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.920
Time to go an exciting adventure!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:07.680
Chaos continues in Japan. The government has issued...

00:15:07.680 --> 00:15:09.680
Buildings are collapsing...

00:15:09.680 --> 00:15:11.270
We're here at the site.

00:15:11.270 --> 00:15:16.480
The area is covered in
thick red dust that obscures the view.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.110
The red dust absorbing radio waves is...

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:45.800
Is it a virus?

00:15:45.800 --> 00:15:50.260
No. It keeps rewriting and upgrading itself.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.600
That was the 551st time.

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:56.660
We have no signal.
Where is the update info coming from?

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:59.690
Everything must be in that song.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:04.530
An egg inside an egg with another egg inside it.

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:06.530
The theory of preformation.

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:08.110
What's that?

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:12.870
A theory that an egg contains
all information about its offspring.

00:16:12.870 --> 00:16:17.960
An egg has information about the
eggs that its chick will lay in the future.

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:24.630
And those eggs have information
about the eggs that their chicks will lay.

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:28.550
Infinite information. That's what's in the message?

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:30.590
The first egg could be simple.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:33.560
Like compressing the Bible into five characters.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:34.640
That's impossible.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:39.390
You can just transmit B-I-B-L-E,
then use the actual book as a reference.

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:40.770
That's just a riddle.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:44.960
Jet Jaguar's memory storage is like a huge library.

00:16:44.960 --> 00:16:51.240
It can compress large amounts of
data if given the titles, pages, and lines.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:56.830
Do you mean it specified the chat dates
as well as Jet Jaguar's memory?

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:57.910
I think so.

00:16:57.910 --> 00:16:59.580
When is the update going to end?

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:03.790
Is Jet Jaguar going to transform into something else?

00:17:03.790 --> 00:17:06.050
Into its latest version.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.970
Can a goose turn into a swan while it's laying an egg?

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:12.140
Stop the engine!

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:14.180
Did it spot us?

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.210
It's coming!

00:17:40.120 --> 00:17:41.620
Where did it go?

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.430
It stopped.

00:18:00.350 --> 00:18:02.690
Why is this path in the cave?

00:18:02.690 --> 00:18:06.120
It's the path Ashihara once took.

00:18:06.730 --> 00:18:07.860
He did?

00:18:08.180 --> 00:18:12.450
He discovered the Singular Point
in this cave 60 years ago.

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:16.450
He built this path to conduct his research.

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.950
You're literally following in his footsteps.

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.330
How did he discover the Singular Point?

00:18:24.330 --> 00:18:27.840
Nobody knows, but they say the song beckoned him.

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:30.090
You mean the lullaby?

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:31.630
You know about it?

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.430
How could a song do that?

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:34.380
I don't know.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:39.860
Maybe he heard the jellyfish sing it,
or Archetype resonated with it.

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:42.350
In any case, Ashihara followed the song

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:46.520
and found the Singular Point
under a red lake in this cave.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:47.810
That's what they say.

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:53.610
There it is

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:55.760
Wow.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:02.620
A red lake...

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:04.490
Over here!

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:08.380
The start of an exciting cruise!

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:13.510
It suddenly started moving and suddenly stopped.

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:15.610
It's still upgrading itself.

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:18.120
It fought during the upgrading process?

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:20.640
Like a knee-jerk response in humans.

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:26.560
If it saved us, it must mean
it hasn't been hacked by the devil.

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.650
Bing.

00:19:28.110 --> 00:19:29.900
I think the upgrade is complete.

00:19:29.900 --> 00:19:31.400
It's going to wake up.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.400
What now?

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:38.410
Friend or foe? Demon or snake? Dream or illusion?

00:19:38.410 --> 00:19:41.250
We'll find out soon.

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:42.450
Vroom.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:47.080
What?

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:50.460
What's that? Are you hungry?

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:53.710
Hungry... Me...

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:55.550
Is it turning into a child?

00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.550
Reconfiguring its vocabulary.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.590
Do you know who I am?

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:01.350
Mama?

00:20:01.350 --> 00:20:04.100
No. Do you know your name?

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:07.850
My name? PP...

00:20:07.850 --> 00:20:09.150
PP?

00:20:09.150 --> 00:20:11.020
Jet Jaguar PP.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.730
Can you count?

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.530
One. Two. Many.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:16.820
What's one plus one?

00:20:16.820 --> 00:20:18.490
One plus one.

00:20:18.490 --> 00:20:20.780
Reading arithmetic module.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.120
Zero, one, two, three...

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.700
Is it learning?

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:27.040
Learning natural numbers with Peano's axioms.

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:28.600
One plus one is two.

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:32.170
Learning integers, fractions, rationals, irrationals.

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:34.500
It mastered the concept of numbers?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.470
Excellent student.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:41.890
Number. 35. 139. 140.

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:44.390
Thirty-five? For what?

00:20:44.390 --> 00:20:49.020
Thirty-five. One hundred thirty-nine.
One hundred forty. I'm going there.

00:20:49.020 --> 00:20:51.100
Go there? Is it a place?

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:53.020
GPS coordinates?

00:20:53.020 --> 00:20:56.900
Latitude 35.681236.

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:58.650
Around Tokyo Station?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:21:00.410
How do you know that?

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:03.160
I used to be in a map lovers' club.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:04.830
What's 140, the last number?

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.750
Altitude 140 meters?

00:21:06.750 --> 00:21:11.170
GPS uses geoid height. It could be 40 meters lower.

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:14.420
A hundred meters over Tokyo Station...

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:17.170
Jet Jaguar, what's there?

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.340
I don't know yet.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:19.420
When will you know?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:20.880
I know already.

00:21:20.880 --> 00:21:24.390
2030081609...

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:25.430
It's that time.

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:28.310
A message tomorrow in the sky over Tokyo Station?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:41.150
Oh, really? If you're going to sing, so will I.

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:12.350
I woke up to your voice that painted my vision with color

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:18.230
And it was the same shade of curiosity I find in my familiar daily life

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:23.610
If this feeling can grow naturally on its own

00:22:23.610 --> 00:22:29.490
Will it fall off one day like an unripe fruit, I wonder?

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:34.120
I don't know anything

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:38.500
Not even anything about you

00:22:41.380 --> 00:22:47.010
Let me keep on dreaming for now

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:51.390
If this moment is all I have now

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:55.850
I can still feel the warmth in my palm

00:22:57.690 --> 00:23:03.110
My thrumming feelings open and burst out

00:23:03.110 --> 00:23:07.120
I want to keep learning more, like I am now

00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:13.660
This pulsating rhythm I feel just won't stop

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:14.620
It won't stop
